  "description": "Runelia is a modern elegant serif font crafted to deliver a luxurious and timeless look for your design projects. Featuring high contrast strokes, refined curves, and graceful letterforms, it is perfect for luxury branding, fashion logos, editorial layouts, packaging, and invitations. This versatile typeface combines classic sophistication with contemporary style, making it ideal for both print and digital use. With ligatures, alternates, and multilingual support, Runelia allows you to create distinctive and professional typography effortlessly.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Runelia is a modern elegant serif font crafted to deliver a luxurious and timeless look for your design projects. Featuring high contrast strokes, refined curves, and graceful letterforms, it is perfect for luxury branding, fashion logos, editorial layouts, packaging, and invitations. This versatile typeface combines classic sophistication with contemporary style, making it ideal for both print and digital use. With ligatures, alternates, and multilingual support, Runelia allows you to create distinctive and professional typography effortlessly.</p>",
